Gary Payton II attended Oregon State University where he played college basketball for the Oregon State Beavers. Before joining Oregon State, he played two seasons at Salt Lake Community College (SLCC), and briefly studied and played basketball at Westwind Preparatory Academy after graduating from Spring Valley High School.

